# Optional. RAWG games-database API key, used server-side to classify the genre
# of titles the built-in keyword rules can't place (those that fall back to
# "Other"). Get a free key at https://rawg.io/apidocs.
#
# Leave it unset to disable RAWG lookups entirely — genre classification then
# relies solely on the keyword rules, exactly as before.
RAWG_API_KEY=
